=== download_eggnog_data.py, create_dbs.py, hmm_mapper.py
--- download_eggnog_data.py -
--data_dir=	directory of the eggnog-mapper databases
--dbname=	name of the directory of the HMM database (with -H -d)
-D 	don't install the Diamond database
-F 	install the novel families databases (emapper.py -m novel_fams)
-H 	install the HMMER database of -d (emapper.py -m hmmer)
-M 	install the MMseqs2 database (emapper.py -m mmseqs)
-P 	install the Pfam database (de novo annotation or realignment)
-d 	tax ID of the eggNOG HMM database to download (with -H)
-f 	download even if the files exist
-h 	show this help message and exit
-q 	quiet mode
-s 	print the commands without downloading
-y 	assume "yes" to all questions
--- download_eggnog_data.py --data_dir data/
data/sub/
--- create_dbs.py -m 
diamond 
mmseqs 
